    <guid isPermaLink="false">66cacc547ae3d6d8d2f06b98</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 25 Aug 2024 06:16:50 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>主播｜大撒 小野</span></p><span></span><p><span>在喧嚣忙碌的生活中，我们常常感到压力山大。虽然时常疲惫，但生活的美好依旧在每个角落等待我们去发现。</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期将和你一起聊聊在充满压力的当下，我们是如何找到简单的快乐的，也期待你的分享～</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期内容时间轴：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="95">01:35</a> 当下现存的压力</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="308">05:08</a> 沉浸爽剧与大熊猫短视频</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="540">09:00</a> 解压视频</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="996">16:36</a> 冥想</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1300">21:40</a> 低谷推荐必读《我与地坛》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1400">23:20</a> 课题分离，不要介入他人因果</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1721">28:41</a> 热爱和悲观并不冲突，时常消极又觉得生活很美好</span></p>]]></description>
